# SuperClaude context keeper: per-branch working memos. Volatile by design --
# never committed, and specifically never swept into a worktree-autosave
# snapshot and pushed to origin, since they carry worktree paths, PIDs, boot
# ids and run identifiers. Three files in .claude/ already ASSERT this is
# gitignored; until this rule existed, all three were wrong (found by
# independent audit, 2026-08-29).
.claude/context/
